rs improve their grades. He likes dishes that his sister Raiha cooks, but hates raw fish. His favorite drink is barley tea, his favorite animals are gorillas and his daily convention is storing one coin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c94551"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e7fcfc5912ce39f84dcd918ab4cc43b9512f1e07d60522dc1b1556aa979d8c1f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/855d159606dbda11aac385db9d0d67f94b753987a9099cdecc6d2f15ad07b249.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松岡 禎丞","creatorId":"vndb:s748","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s748","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s748","name":"松岡 禎丞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90406","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c94552","characterName":"中野 一花","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c94552"},"originalCharacterName":"中野 一花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"505"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The eldest sister, she has short hair without any accessories. Ichika acts like a responsible older sister - she's caring, thoughtful and wise. She enjoys sleeping and her room is incredibly messy. She aspires to become a movie actress and dedicates most of her time and resources to do so, 