ful, friendly and good at sports, her constantly active personality can annoy others. She likes citrus unshiu, but hates bell peppers. She likes watching anime and loves drinking carbonated fruit juice. Her favorite animals are camels, her best subject is Japanese, and her daily convention is watering plants."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c94555"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/61454fc584fc889b7654c252a7ef7c599c7a220d12bb304f985907db6c4a7494.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9d34ac14c13a19482e980b3da4054d360d8cb8356f849a141bda68ad436c9bd.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐倉 綾音","creatorId":"vndb:s3892","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3892","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3892","name":"佐倉 綾音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90409","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c94556","characterName":"中野 五月","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c94556"},"originalCharacterName":"中野 五月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"505"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The fifth and the youngest sister, she has an expressive ahoge, long hair with two twirling \"streams\" and two stars beside her eyes. Her blood type is A. She has a two-faced personality; she's always friendly with acquaintances and classmates but Futaro's presence immediately puts her in attack mode due to his past insults. She loves to eat food and studies seriously, even though her methods need improvement. She likes meat and curry but hates umeboshi. Her favorite animal is the kangaroo. Her favorite TV program type is wasei-eigo. Her best subject is science and her daily convention is exercising abdominal muscles and doing yoga"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c94556"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/30eccaea00aa282c5dd811ea17612c6f31f76d6523bee4b3068b53af8e9876cc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/434dc1fd3ad5db0554a8aba2ac1489c20ad7ca67b08d177cf83d90f1c5224540.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水瀬 いのり","creatorId":"vndb:s5082","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5082","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5082","name":"水瀬 いのり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90410","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c95121","characterName":"上杉 らいは","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c95121"},"originalCharacterName":"上杉 らいは","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fuutarou's cheerful younger sister. The only female in the family and the most family-conscious, she is effectively the head of the small household. Her cute facial expressions will often sway others' hearts. Appreciating the hard work Fuutarou does for their family, she sometimes delays supper until he returns home so she can prepare his favorite meal."},{"spoiler":fal